targeted comments per month\n\nA focused comment campaign built to show up in relevant Reddit, Quora, and X conversations.\n\n100-140\n\ncomments per month\n\n8\n\noptional monthly posts\n\nRead the full story\n↗\nCr\n\nCreator Content Launch\n\nContent\n30-60 short-form videos per month\n\nA UGC and creator collaboration setup designed to increase content output around a young brand.\n\n30-60\n\nshort-form videos\n\n5-10\n\ncreator collaboration deals\n\nRead the full story\n↗\nOu\n\nOutbound Pipeline Setup\n\nOutbound\nLinkedIn and B2B email activity in one system\n\nA LinkedIn and B2B email campaign structure for direct communication with targeted users.\n\n15-20/day\n\nLinkedIn connections\n\n60/day\n\nB2B emails sent\n\nRead the full story\n↗\n←\n\nCase study 1 of 4\n\n→\nHow We Can Help\n\nStop the guesswork and choose from one of our proven channels to unlock targeted growth that turns attention into revenue.\n\nComment Campaign\n\nPost targeted comments on relevant Reddit, Quora, and X threads to build awareness and bring more interested users back to your site.\n\nLearn more\n↗\nUGC Content Creation\n\nPublish 30-60 short-form videos each month on YouTube Shorts and TikTok through brand-specific content accounts.\n\nLearn more\n↗\nCreator Collabs\n\nManage 5-10 creator collaboration deals across YouTube, LinkedIn, X, and TikTok to release dedicated content around your brand.\n\nLearn more\n↗\nLinkedIn Outreaching\n\nManage executive LinkedIn accounts to create more calls and sign-ups through targeted outreach.\n\nLearn more\n↗\nEmail B2B Campaigns\n\nLaunch a structured B2B email campaign with inbox setup, domains, lead generation, and 60 emails per day.\n\nLearn more\n↗\nHear it from our clients\n\"Significantly cheaper than other agencies with higher output and consistent results\"\n\nVincent Josse\n\nCEO @ BlogSEO\n\n\"Text testimonial placeholder for clear channel strategy, faster shipping, and more confidence in what to focus on next.\"\n\nMarketing lead placeholder\n\nConsumer startup\n\nPlaceholder\n\n\"Text testimonial placeholder focused on practical support, straightforward deliverables, and steady momentum across channels.\"\n\nCEO placeholder\n\nEarly-stage brand\n\nPlaceholder\n\n\"Text feedback placeholder about keeping priorities clear, reporting simple, and progress visible every week.\"\n\nTeam lead placeholder\n\nService business\n\nPlaceholder\n\nPAGE 1 OF 2\n\nFAQ\n\nEverything you need to know about Lumivale and how we help grow your customer channels.\n\ntest 2\n+\n\ntest 2\n\nWhat if the Reddit comments and posts get moderated?\n+\ntes 3\n+\ntest 4\n+\n\nSTART HERE\n\nLight up the next growth channel for your brand.\nBook a call\n↗\nLumivale\n\nLight up your growth.\n\nHome\nAbout\nBlogs\n\nCONTACT US\n\nkenny.lumivale@gmail.com\n\nwww.lumivale.net\n\nLinkedIn ↗\n© 2026 Lumivale\n\nLight up to your growth.",
